SITL JSON: read rng_1..rng_6 into rangefinders 1..6

Backport of the ArduPilot master fix in libraries/SITL/SIM_JSON.cpp. Copter-4.7.2 tests
bitmask bits 7..12 for the rangefinder fields, but RNG_1..RNG_6 are bits 10..15, so a physics
backend that sends a quaternion (ardupilot_gazebo) never delivers rng_1 and RNGFND1_TYPE 100
reports "No Data". SITL-only code: flight firmware is unaffected. Drop this patch when the
ArduPilot pin moves to a release that contains the fix (deps/README.md).

--- a/libraries/SITL/SIM_JSON.cpp
+++ b/libraries/SITL/SIM_JSON.cpp
@@ -462,11 +462,11 @@
     update_position();

     // update range finder distances
-    for (uint8_t i=7; i<13; i++) {
-        if ((received_bitmask &  1ULL << i) == 0) {
+    for (uint8_t i=0; i<6; i++) {
+        if ((received_bitmask & (RNG_1 << i)) == 0) {
             continue;
         }
-        rangefinder_m[i-7] = state.rng[i-7];
+        rangefinder_m[i] = state.rng[i];
     }

     // update wind vane
